{"id":"2ae549c14f89182f","group":"92","path":"92/92-lem-abstract-diagonal.md","title":"Abstract Diagonal Lemma D","display":"lem-abstract-diagonal — Abstract Diagonal Lemma D","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-lem-abstract-diagonal","aliases":["92-lem-abstract-diagonal"],"display":"lem-abstract-diagonal — Abstract Diagonal Lemma D","source":"第 I 章 p. 8，Lemma D（PDF 25）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-abstract-expressibility]]","[[92-df-diagonal-pullback]]","[[92-df-semantic-godel-sentence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-lem-abstract-diagonal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-lem-abstract-diagonal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-abstract-diagonal — Abstract Diagonal Lemma D"},{"key":"source","html":"第 I 章 p. 8，Lemma D（PDF 25）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8dcd8ee3e47cef44\" href=\"?note=8dcd8ee3e47cef44\" title=\"92-df-abstract-expressibility\">92-df-abstract-expressibility</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"73782856c9b2f46a\" href=\"?note=73782856c9b2f46a\" title=\"92-df-diagonal-pullback\">92-df-diagonal-pullback</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"935ae20b7597689e\" href=\"?note=935ae20b7597689e\" title=\"92-df-semantic-godel-sentence\">92-df-semantic-godel-sentence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L=(E,S,P,R,H,\\Phi,T,g,d)\">\\(\\mathcal L=(E,S,P,R,H,\\Phi,T,g,d)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IncLang}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{IncLang}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\in H\">\\(K\\in H\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h=g(K)\">\\(h=g(K)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=\\Phi(K,h)\">\\(X=\\Phi(K,h)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExprBy}_{\\mathcal L},\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\mathrm{ExprBy}_{\\mathcal L},\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> 是抽象可表达关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{G1}\">\\(\\mathrm{G1}\\)</span> 是对角逆像封闭条件；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SemGdl}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\mathrm{SemGdl}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> 是语义 Gödel 句关系，均取自列出的直接依赖。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}diagonal}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{ExprBy}_{\\mathcal L}(K,A_{\\mathcal L}^{*})&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SemGdl}_{\\mathcal L}(\\Phi(K,g(K)),A),\\\\\n\\mathrm{G1}(\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}(A)&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists X\\in S\\;\\mathrm{SemGdl}_{\\mathcal L}(X,A).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}diagonal}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{ExprBy}_{\\mathcal L}(K,A_{\\mathcal L}^{*})&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SemGdl}_{\\mathcal L}(\\Phi(K,g(K)),A),\\\\\n\\mathrm{G1}(\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}(A)&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists X\\in S\\;\\mathrm{SemGdl}_{\\mathcal L}(X,A).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in T\\leftrightarrow h\\in A^*\\leftrightarrow d(h)\\in A\\leftrightarrow g(X)\\in A\">\\(X\\in T\\leftrightarrow h\\in A^*\\leftrightarrow d(h)\\in A\\leftrightarrow g(X)\\in A\\)</span>。首个等价用可表达性，最后一个用合法表达式的对角值条件。没有调用有效性、可证性、普通一致性或强数码函数表示。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 I 章 p. 8，Lemma D（PDF 25）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-abstract-expressibility","status":"resolved","id":"8dcd8ee3e47cef44","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-abstract-expressibility]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-diagonal-pullback","status":"resolved","id":"73782856c9b2f46a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-diagonal-pullback]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-semantic-godel-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"935ae20b7597689e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-semantic-godel-sentence]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L=(E,S,P,R,H,\\Phi,T,g,d)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IncLang}(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"K\\in H","display":false},{"tex":"h=g(K)","display":false},{"tex":"X=\\Phi(K,h)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ExprBy}_{\\mathcal L},\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{G1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SemGdl}_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}diagonal}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{ExprBy}_{\\mathcal L}(K,A_{\\mathcal L}^{*})&\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SemGdl}_{\\mathcal L}(\\Phi(K,g(K)),A),\\\\\n\\mathrm{G1}(\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}(A)&\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists X\\in S\\;\\mathrm{SemGdl}_{\\mathcal L}(X,A).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"X\\in T\\leftrightarrow h\\in A^*\\leftrightarrow d(h)\\in A\\leftrightarrow g(X)\\in A","display":false}],"bytes":1604,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-abstract-incompleteness-language]] → [[92-df-abstract-expressibility]] → [[92-df-diagonal-pullback]] → [[92-lem-abstract-diagonal]]。"},{"id":"97f80cc5c73f0d60","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1d0a7d81ddf7d082","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"fc6f6230ad54a0dc","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-225","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-lem-abstract-diagonal]]"}],"outgoing":["8dcd8ee3e47cef44","73782856c9b2f46a","935ae20b7597689e"]}